# AI Career OS
## UI Component Library Specification v1.0

---

# Purpose

This document defines every reusable UI component used throughout AI Career OS.

No page should create its own version of an existing component.

All components must be reusable, composable, accessible, responsive, and consistent with the Design System.

---

# Component Design Principles

Every component must be:

- Reusable
- Configurable
- Responsive
- Accessible
- Theme-aware
- Type-safe
- Stateless whenever possible
- Performance optimized

Components should never contain business logic.

Business logic belongs in hooks, services, or server actions.

---

# Component Categories

## Layout

- AppShell
- Sidebar
- Topbar
- BottomNavigation
- Breadcrumb
- Container
- PageHeader
- Section
