## Navigation

### SidebarNavigation

Purpose

Main application navigation.

Supports

- Nested items
- Icons
- Active state
- Collapsible groups
- Badges

---

### Breadcrumb

Displays current navigation path.

Example

Dashboard

↓

Careers

↓

AI Engineer

---

### SearchBar

Supports

- Global search
- Suggestions
- Keyboard shortcuts
- Recent searches

